  "description": "Side drawer for Desktop and bottom sheet for Mobile, composed with system primitives for inspectors, multi-field forms, or filters.\n\nVariants & Properties:\n- Position: Right (Web) (360px, left corners rounded) | Bottom (Mobile) (360px with top drag handle, top corners rounded, and full-width MD footer buttons).\n- Use: Default | Form | Filter.\n- Properties: 👁️ Close, 👁️ Description, 👁️ Footer, ✏️ Title, ✏️ Description.\n\nDesign & hierarchy rules:\n- Always pair over OVERLAY.\n- In SheetFooter always pair 1 secondary button (Outline for Cancel/Reset) with 1 Primary confirmation button; never place two Primary buttons side by side.\n- Use Dialog for centered short confirmations; use Popover for small trigger-anchored controls.",
